1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,924
Imagine thinking your 10-leg parlay is a good bet.

2
00:00:03,224 --> 00:00:05,752
Each leg, the book keeps about 4.5%.

3
00:00:06,052 --> 00:00:08,024
Stack 10? It keeps 37%.

4
00:00:08,424 --> 00:00:16,401
Your real odds of hitting all 10: 1 IN 1,024. They pay you about 643× your money.

5
00:00:16,701 --> 00:00:19,180
A fair price would be 1,024×.

6
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:22,877
So where did the other 381 go? Their pocket.

7
00:00:23,277 --> 00:00:25,901
Most legs you've ever hit? Be honest. Comment.

8
00:00:26,201 --> 00:00:27,834
Follow for more math they hate.

